<article class="tm-article">
  <nav class="tm-breadcrumb"><a href="/hc/en-us">Help Center</a> / Where is my order?</nav>

  <p>As soon as your order is placed you receive an order confirmation by email. From that moment you can follow every step – from picking in our warehouse to delivery at your door – in <strong>My account</strong> under <strong>Orders</strong>.</p>

  <div class="tm-callout">
    <strong>Quick check:</strong> Log in, open <strong>My account → Orders</strong> and click the order number. The current status and, once shipped, the carrier's tracking link are shown at the top of the page.
  </div>

  <h2>What the order statuses mean</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Received:</strong> We have your order and are checking payment. Nothing has been picked yet, so changes are still possible.</li>
    <li><strong>In progress:</strong> The items are being picked and packed in our warehouse. Orders placed before 15:00 on weekdays are usually packed the same day.</li>
    <li><strong>Shipped:</strong> Your parcel has been handed to the carrier. The tracking link becomes active within a few hours.</li>
    <li><strong>Partially shipped:</strong> One or more items are on the way; the rest will follow in a separate parcel at no extra cost.</li>
    <li><strong>Delivered:</strong> The carrier has confirmed delivery. If you haven't received the parcel, check with neighbours and your parcel shop first.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Items with a waiting time</h2>
  <p>Some products are shown with an expected availability date. If your order contains such an item, we hold the complete order until everything is in stock. Prefer to receive the available items first? Contact us and we will split the shipment for you.</p>

  <h2>Tracking shows no movement</h2>
  <p>It can take up to 24 hours after shipping before the carrier's system updates. If the tracking has not changed for more than three working days, <a href="/hc/en-us/requests/new">get in touch</a> with your order number and we will open an enquiry with the carrier straight away.</p>

